<p>
  Shared state is a <code>Y.Map</code> of shape records (x, y, text, color).
  Double-click to add a note, drag to move it, type to edit it. Canvas tools
  like tldraw and Excalidraw keep their document as a record store and bind
  it to a <code>Y.Map</code> the same way, so the same provider works under
  them.
</p>
